{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In \u2018A Nice Game About Balls\u2019 you\u2019ll use your wits, your cunning (and a keyboard or gamepad) to roll your balls, avoid the obstacles, clean out your opponents, and claim sweet, sweet, sweet victory, yeah, and it's yours for the taking.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Balls... hopes to provide some chill, skill-based satisfaction, some highs, some lows, and some weirdness thrown in for good measure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Disclaimer: this game is a work in progress, and features may change. \ud83d\udc4d</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4079120/extras/b7ed59135397700e5783e1ed0c546552.avif?t=1768811458\" alt=\"Go on an adventure! Kinda!\" width=780 height=70 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Start a campaign, choose your route, earn points, collect cards, and deploy game-winning buffs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In a head-to-head match, they get 3 balls, and you get 3 balls. May the best ball slinger win.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4079120/extras/c5b5fa2f6c5a9968a2bfc83116fc7943.avif?t=1768811458\" alt=\"Boss fights!\" width=780 height=70 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight your way past the underlings and take on the area bosses! They don\u2019t always play fair, but remember that the bosses can be a bit touchy and winning means a lot to them, so be nice.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4079120/extras/b5d05affc2fbff4a2aae45c6bcd9d20d.avif?t=1768811458\" alt=\"Deck building!\" width=780 height=70 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some opponents are just naturally <i>better </i>than you, and that sucks. To even things out, you can collect buff cards and deploy them at the perfect time to give yourself the advantage - wiping that smug self-satisfied look from your foe\u2019s face.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4079120/extras/c494ae64f018dbdea4546324791897fa.avif?t=1768811458\" alt=\"Trick shots!\" width=780 height=70 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fighting your way through a full competitive campaign can be challenging, so instead you can unlock chilled skill levels. No opponents, no limitations, just keep rolling the balls until you make an awesome shot you can upload to the internet and you become a huge celebrity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4079120/extras/ceb549799982748e697b7eb1f08c02e4.avif?t=1768811458\" alt=\"Human vs. human!\" width=780 height=70 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >For each level unlocked, \u2018A Nice Game About Balls\u2019 allows you to replay it locally against a friend, family member, or a pet, maybe. Just roll some balls and do your best. We\u2019re all friends here.<br><br>Oh, but it\u2019s unlikely to be an online mode because there\u2019s no way in hell I can afford that.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4079120/extras/e369565a00ed9e6fbaf3611e4372f1d8.avif?t=1768811458\" alt=\"You vs... you?\" width=780 height=70 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >For each game played, your score will be recorded and a judgement will be provided. Why settle for an F grade when you can play again and get a C? Works for me.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4079120/extras/654d315930c1d884c97f26c126fb2b9d.avif?t=1768811458\" alt=\"And more! Maybe!\" width=780 height=70 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To be honest I haven\u2019t completely figured everything out yet, so I may have better ideas at some point. Who can say!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>NOTE</strong>: Development is in the early stages, so the screenshots and videos here are a work-in-progress - expect things to change!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4079120?t=1768811458","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4079120/c93b134da40766a6782a4483bbc143d3724490df/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1768811458","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4079120/8096bc31ea8525997e05efd8e3db1534cdd98b4c/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1768811458","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4079120/8096bc31ea8525997e05efd8e3db1534cdd98b4c/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1768811458","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen PvP","id":37},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen Co-op","id":39},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen","id":24},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Remote Play Together","id":44},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In \u2018A Nice Game About Balls\u2019 you\u2019ll use your wits, your cunning (and a keyboard or gamepad) to roll your balls, avoid the obstacles, clean out your opponents, and claim sweet, sweet, sweet victory, yeah, and it's yours for the taking.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Balls... hopes to provide some chill, skill-based satisfaction, some highs, some lows, and some weirdness thrown in for good measure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Disclaimer: this game is a work in progress, and features may change. \ud83d\udc4d</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4079120/extras/b7ed59135397700e5783e1ed0c546552.avif?t=1768811458\" alt=\"Go on an adventure! Kinda!\" width=780 height=70 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Start a campaign, choose your route, earn points, collect cards, and deploy game-winning buffs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In a head-to-head match, they get 3 balls, and you get 3 balls. May the best ball slinger win.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4079120/extras/c5b5fa2f6c5a9968a2bfc83116fc7943.avif?t=1768811458\" alt=\"Boss fights!\" width=780 height=70 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight your way past the underlings and take on the area bosses! They don\u2019t always play fair, but remember that the bosses can be a bit touchy and winning means a lot to them, so be nice.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4079120/extras/b5d05affc2fbff4a2aae45c6bcd9d20d.avif?t=1768811458\" alt=\"Deck building!\" width=780 height=70 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some opponents are just naturally <i>better </i>than you, and that sucks. To even things out, you can collect buff cards and deploy them at the perfect time to give yourself the advantage - wiping that smug self-satisfied look from your foe\u2019s face.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4079120/extras/c494ae64f018dbdea4546324791897fa.avif?t=1768811458\" alt=\"Trick shots!\" width=780 height=70 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fighting your way through a full competitive campaign can be challenging, so instead you can unlock chilled skill levels. No opponents, no limitations, just keep rolling the balls until you make an awesome shot you can upload to the internet and you become a huge celebrity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4079120/extras/ceb549799982748e697b7eb1f08c02e4.avif?t=1768811458\" alt=\"Human vs. human!\" width=780 height=70 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >For each level unlocked, \u2018A Nice Game About Balls\u2019 allows you to replay it locally against a friend, family member, or a pet, maybe. Just roll some balls and do your best. We\u2019re all friends here.<br><br>Oh, but it\u2019s unlikely to be an online mode because there\u2019s no way in hell I can afford that.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4079120/extras/e369565a00ed9e6fbaf3611e4372f1d8.avif?t=1768811458\" alt=\"You vs... you?\" width=780 height=70 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >For each game played, your score will be recorded and a judgement will be provided. Why settle for an F grade when you can play again and get a C? Works for me.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4079120/extras/654d315930c1d884c97f26c126fb2b9d.avif?t=1768811458\" alt=\"And more! Maybe!\" width=780 height=70 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To be honest I haven\u2019t completely figured everything out yet, so I may have better ideas at some point. Who can say!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>NOTE</strong>: Development is in the early stages, so the screenshots and videos here are a work-in-progress - expect things to change!</p>","developers":["Thumb Flame Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Sports","id":"18"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4079120/111a7aae633d90e4a813ea9ac8aecd7881a9a03c/header.jpg?t=1768811458","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Ubuntu 12.04 LTS<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i3<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 2 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Relatively modern dedicated graphics card<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 200 MB available space</li></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> macOS 10.13<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Apple Silicon (M-series)<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 200 MB available space</li></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4079120/521742393/970ac2b76ad95b146b7213fc8f1311e78cbad856/1759757065/dash_av1.mpd?t=1760981843","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4079120/521742393/970ac2b76ad95b146b7213fc8f1311e78cbad856/1759757065/dash_h264.mpd?t=1760981843","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4079120/521742393/970ac2b76ad95b146b7213fc8f1311e78cbad856/1759757065/hls_26